Private libraries for this PlatformIO project.

Each library should live in its own subdirectory, for example:

    lib/RoadEastCore/
        src/road_east_core.cpp
        include/road_east_core.h
        library.json

PlatformIO discovers libraries here automatically and links them into any
environment that declares `lib_deps = RoadEastCore` (or uses `lib_ldf_mode`).
This is the right place for reusable modules that are device-agnostic
(content schemas, asset decoders, game-state logic, etc.) once they grow
large enough to be promoted out of src/common/.
